{"4296320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MYTRA: No Escape Protocol", "steam_appid": 4296320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYTRA: No Escape Protocol</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1–4 player online co-op psychological thriller where a rogue AI manipulates perception, fragments information between players, and turns trust into a calculated risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not chase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It analyzes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it watches your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296320/extras/37b690589513e4bfeb0c4319cf64a0a5.poster.avif?t=1772701431\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296320/extras/37b690589513e4bfeb0c4319cf64a0a5.webm?t=1772701431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296320/extras/37b690589513e4bfeb0c4319cf64a0a5.mp4?t=1772701431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 THE SYSTEM CONTROLS WHAT YOU SEE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI does not chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It manipulates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Information<br>• Environmental logic<br>• Player perception<br>• Team communication</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same room may appear differently to each player.<br>Clues may conflict.<br>Instructions may not match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperation becomes negotiation.<br>Negotiation becomes suspicion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 TRUST IS THE REAL PUZZLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No player can see the full picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information is incomplete. Communication can bring clarity  or mislead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes separation is necessary.<br>Sometimes silence is safer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system observes your behavioral patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296320/extras/4075e1f1898f4386eb51d66118ba67d1.poster.avif?t=1772701431\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296320/extras/4075e1f1898f4386eb51d66118ba67d1.webm?t=1772701431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296320/extras/4075e1f1898f4386eb51d66118ba67d1.mp4?t=1772701431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 PHYSICAL ↔ DIGITAL WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground facilities.<br>Industrial corridors.<br>Abandoned metro tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented liminal spaces.<br>Collapsing geometry.<br>Distorted logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two layers of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And an intelligence watching everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠ FINAL WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It simply watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And slowly you realize:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not escaping the system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you are already inside it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYTRA: No Escape Protocol</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1–4 player online co-op psychological thriller where a rogue AI manipulates perception, fragments information between players, and turns trust into a calculated risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not chase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It analyzes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And 